Recorded flights of an independent TLS 1.3 server, OpenSSL's s_server, against surf's
client, on 127.0.0.1 (story tls-handshake, docs/design/tls.md item 10.5). Recorded by
crates/tls/examples/record-flights.rs in the lane slow (task tls-flights-slow); the
tests of tests/tls/flights.rs replay them and start no process.

implementation: OpenSSL 3.6.5 29 Sep 2026 (Library: OpenSSL 3.6.5 29 Sep 2026)
recorded: 2026-11-22
recordings: 6

A file holds: SFLT, the format version 1, the number of draws, each draw (32 bytes),
the client's bytes and the server's bytes, each after a 4-byte length. The draws are
the client's random, session id, x25519 key and secp256r1 key from /dev/urandom:
secrets of a test session on loopback, used by nothing else. The server's private keys
are those of crates/tls-test-certs/certs/ and are not in these files.

